      170.49,
      203.09,
      393.32,
      214.43
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MINUWANGODA SINHA FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      227.69,
      401.89,
      300.59
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cMinuwangoda Sinha Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      313.85,
      401.9,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      387.65,
      401.89,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.49,
      401.74,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Minuwangoda SinhaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      461.45,
      401.93,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as presently are the membersof the \u201cMinuwangoda Sinha Foundation\u201d (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admittedas members of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall bea body corporate (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of the \u201cMinuwangoda Sinha Foundation\u201d and bythat name may sue and be sued with full power and authorityto have and use a common seal and to alter the same at itspleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.05,
      401.87,
      632.63
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      645.89,
      401.9,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)to assist individuals, families and communities indisadvantaged circumstances;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      461.11,
      455.86,
      508.58
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof theMinuwangodaSinhaFoundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
