      203.09,
      397.19,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(b)to assist families of workers, farmers and such otherpersons which have become indigent due to loss ofemployment, illness, disability, death or othercauses;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      264.65,
      397.19,
      325.19
    ],
    "text": "(c)to advise and assist workers who have voluntarliyresigned, retired or returned from foreignemployment with regard to the management of theirsavings or establishment of small or medium scaleenterprises;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      338.45,
      397.2,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "(d)to provide counselling and assistance to familiesof foreign employed workers to promote the well-being of such families;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
