      498.29,
      397.17,
      521.99
    ],
    "text": "(g)to provide counselling services for persons havingpsychological difficulties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      535.25,
      397.2,
      583.43
    ],
    "text": "(h)to provide or arrange to provide vocational trainingand assistance to disadvantaged young persons toengage in self-employment or to secure otheremployment;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      596.69,
      397.18,
      620.39
    ],
    "text": "(i)to provide or assist in providing or improvinghouses for families in disadvantaged circumstances;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      633.65,
      397.2,
      669.59
    ],
