      239.03
    ],
    "text": "(k)to take steps to discourage smoking, alcohol, drugaddiction and to rehabilitate who are subject tosuch addiction;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      252.29,
      401.88,
      275.99
    ],
    "text": "(l)to promote the protection and improvement of theenvironment;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      176.13,
      289.25,
      401.89,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "(m)to carry out such other acts in the opinion of theBoard of Management of the Corporation as arenecessary, conducive or incidental to the attainmentof the aforesaid objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      350.69,
      401.87,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act, and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      387.65,
      401.89,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "(a) acquire, hold or take any immovable property forthe Corporation or give on lease or hire, mortgage,pledge, sell, exchange or otherwise alienate,encumber or dispose of any immovable property ofthe Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      461.45,
      401.9,
      521.99
    ],
    "text": "(b) enter into and perform or carry out whether directlyor through any officer or agent authorized in thatbehalf by the Corporation, all such contracts oragreements as may be necessary for the attainmentof the objects or the exercise of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      181.29,
      535.25,
      401.89,
      558.83
    ],
    "text": "(c) accept gifts, donations and bequests in cash or inkind;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      572.09,
      401.88,
      620.39
    ],
    "text": "(d) advance or lend and borrow money for thepurposes of the Corporation in such a mannerand upon such security as the Corporation maythink fit;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
