    "text": "9.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allmoneys heretofore or hereafter received by way of gift,bequest, donations, subscription, contribution, fees or grantsfor and on account of the Corporation shall be deposited tothe credit of the Corporation in one or more banks as theBoard shall determine.",
